 *   5. Attempt to access with wrong attachmentId (expect 404 or error).
 *   6. (If possible) Remove log or attachment, then try retrieve (expect error).
 *   7. Attempt as unauthorized user (simulate role switch) to confirm admin-only access (expect forbidden/unauthorized).
