 * 2. Use productSnapshots.create (POST /shoppingMallAiBackend/admin/products/{productId}/productSnapshots) under the new product, passing ICreate payload for a snapshot
 * 3. Use productSnapshots.update (PUT /shoppingMallAiBackend/admin/products/{productId}/productSnapshots/{productSnapshotId}) as admin, updating mutable fields
 * 4. Assert returned snapshot reflects changes in mutable fields only, others remain identical to original snapshot
 * 5. (Optional) Attempt update as non-admin and expect error/forbidden
 */
