 * 3. Attempt login using api.functional.auth.admin.login.signIn with that same email/password
 *    - Assert response contains valid JWT, correct setHeaders.Authorization, and profile info (adminId, email, name, role, status; typia.assert, TestValidator)
 * 4. Check that JWT in setHeaders.Authorization matches jwt field (if both are present per contract)
 * 5. If feasible, assert proper audit/compliance logging was triggered (if such outputs are externally accessible) or note coverage
 */
