 * 3. Request records filtered by type ("PRODUCT"), validate only product records are returned
 * 4. Request records filtered by type ("ADDRESS"), validate only address records are returned
 * 5. Apply created_at_from/to range filters to validate date range works
 * 6. Request with limit=1 and ensure pagination metadata/pages reflect correct total
 * 7. Request with filter that returns no records (e.g., invalid id), validate result is empty and pagination correct
