 *    - Values for the returned fields match the input (where applicable) and business logic
 * 5. (Optional, if listing/search API available) Attempt to search for the created product in the catalog to confirm it appears (skip if no such API exists)
 *
 * This test does NOT create sellers directly as no seller API or DTO is provided; instead, the test uses the admin's own id for `seller_id`. This constraint is noted and the test will accept this business compromise.
 */
export async function test_api_admin_product_creation_valid_data(
