 * 5. Attempt to add a second product option (Option B) under the same product, using the EXACT same SKU as Option A.
 *    - This must trigger a business logic error due to the unique constraint violation on SKU per product.
 * 6. Confirm that the duplicate option creation fails by validating error occurrence.
 */
