 * 6. Attempt to fetch a section using a random invalid UUID (not belonging to any section) – expect a not found error.
 *
 * Edge Cases:
 * - Validate the API responds with the proper error on access to a deleted section.
 * - Validate that a random invalid UUID does not leak information about existing data.
 * - Ensure proper type assertion and error testing per spec: only functional errors, not TypeScript compilation/test-structure errors.
 *
 * API/DTOs used:
 * - Admin registration: api.functional.auth.admin.register.signUp
 * - Channel create: api.functional.shoppingMallAiBackend.admin.channels.create
 * - Section create: api.functional.shoppingMallAiBackend.admin.channels.sections.createSection
 * - Section delete (soft): api.functional.shoppingMallAiBackend.admin.channels.sections.eraseSection
 * - Section get: api.functional.shoppingMallAiBackend.admin.channels.sections.at
 */
