  await api.functional.shoppingMallAiBackend.seller.products.productChannelMap.eraseProductChannelMap(connection, {
    productId: product.id,
    productChannelMapId: mapping.id,
  });

  // 7. (Validation) – There is no SDK function to query channel maps by product or channel, so we cannot check deleted_at via API.
