 *
 * Business context:
 * This workflow simulates a real-world compliance intervention: after a customer writes a product review and relevant snapshot is created, an admin corrects/annotates compliance metadata using the review snapshot update API. This ensures that allowed fields are mutable and all audit trails remain intact, but protected fields cannot be tampered with.
