 * 2. Create an order group (admin-only privilege).
 * 3. Retrieve group details as admin – confirm all fields (including admin/metadata fields).
 * 4. Attempt to retrieve group using a random (nonexistent) UUID – expect not found.
 * 5. Attempt to retrieve group with an invalid UUID format – expect error (bad request/validation).
