 *
 * Ensures that when an admin attempts to delete a product that was already soft-deleted, the API returns a 404 Not Found error and no changes are applied on the second call. The test covers full workflow from authentication through product creation, deletion, and error validation, reflecting business and audit requirements for compliance.
 *
