 * 5. Confirm that a forbidden/authorization error is returned (API rejects update attempt).
 * 6. Authenticate as customer1 and (ideally) retrieve the order again to validate that NONE of the order's fields changed by the unauthorized update attempt. Note: as the API does not provide a get-by-id endpoint, this step is commented for future completeness.
