 * payment log creation, then an update (PATCH/PUT) of the log's mutable context field, as permitted by the schema.
 * The test ensures:
 *  - Only allowed (mutable) fields are changed (log_context)
 *  - Immutable fields (id, order_payment_id, log_type, occurred_at) remain unchanged
 *  - Updates are properly reflected without breaking audit trail/integrity.
 *  - Workflow is end-to-end: starting from customer sign up to final validation
 *
 * **Steps performed:**
