 *
 * Business context: E-commerce platforms maintain immutable snapshots of reviews for evidence, dispute, audit, and compliance. Admins must be able to retrieve full details of any review's snapshot (including AI moderation data and actor/audit chain) to support forensic analysis and compliance requirements. Ensuring all fields are intact and linked to the correct actor and review is critical for legal audit trails.
 *
 * The test covers:
